    {
      "id": "why-compass",
      "title": "Why Compass ?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "media",
          "media": "m-16c254ddaa"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>At Compass International, we believe technology should empower growth, not complicate it. As a trusted IT partner based in Dubai, we bring clarity, direction, and innovation to every project—helping businesses navigate the complexities of digital transformation with confidence.</p> <p>With a deep understanding of regional and global markets, we specialize in delivering tailored IT solutions that align with your unique goals. Whether it's enterprise software integration, cloud infrastructure, or custom development, our approach is always strategic, scalable, and future-ready.</p> <p>What sets us apart is not just what we do—but how we do it. We combine technical expertise with a collaborative mindset, working closely with clients to create impact-driven outcomes. From startups to government entities, organizations choose Compass because we don’t just build solutions—we build partnerships that last.</p> <p>Let us be your guide in a world of constant change.</p></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
